CODEGEN.md §4.4, DECISIONS 292: a constant of type Pair (enumerate, zip) has no representation in generated code; baked go refuses it with E8012 at the constant, as a Range, instead of failing the build.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A reward.
variant Reward {
  /// Gold.
  gold
  /// An item.
  item {
    /// How many.
    count: Int
  }
}

/// Each number with its index.
const P = [1, 2].enumerate()

/// Numbers zipped with names.
const Z = [1, 2].zip(["a", "b"])

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8012]  a/a.canon:15:7
  P cannot be emitted: Pair(Int, Int) has no representation in generated code

error[E8012]  a/a.canon:18:7
  Z cannot be emitted: Pair(Int, String) has no representation in generated code

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
